-- EXPECT FULFILLED   (the duty is performed)
#TRACE `s 715.41(1) the prosecutor's duty to apply after the deadline` AT 0 WITH
    PARTY `the prosecutor` DOES `s 715.41(1) apply to the court in writing for an order` AT 3

-- EXPECT STANDING   (no time limit is stated, so the duty stands)
